    "faq_XjyrqX": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_tHQEij": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "1. How does RORRY Buy More, Save More work?",
            "text": "<p>Choose eligible products from this collection. Buy one item and use code <strong>RORRY15</strong> to save <strong>15%</strong>, buy two and use code <strong>RORRY20</strong> to save <strong>20%</strong>, or buy three or more and use code <strong>RORRY25</strong> to save <strong>25%</strong> at checkout.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "question_UJRxzq": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "2. Can I mix and match different RORRY chargers?",
            "text": "<p>Yes. You can mix and match eligible portable chargers, power banks, and charging stations from this collection. The qualifying discount is based on the number of eligible items in your order.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "question_w8dAMF": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "3. Which charging setup is best for college students?",
            "text": "<p>For a dorm desk, choose a multi-device station such as <a href=\"/products/rorry-auradock-m2-10000mah-4-in-1-charging-station-with-magnetic-power-bank-30w\" title=\"RORRY AuraDock M2-10000mAh 4 in 1 Charging Station with Magnetic Power Bank 30W\"><strong>AuraDock M2</strong></a> and add a portable charger for class. For a lighter campus setup, pair the slim <a href=\"/products/rorry-d14-5000mah-megsafe-power-bank\" title=\"RORRY D14 Magsafe Power Bank(5K,Slim)\"><strong>D14</strong></a> magnetic power bank with CharmGo <a href=\"/products/rorry-d3-12000mah-portable-charger-keychain-power-bank-30w-retractable-cable\" title=\"RORRY CharmGo D3-12000mAh Portable Charger Keychain Power Bank 30W\"><strong>D3</strong></a>. For weekends or laptop charging, <a href=\"/products/rorry-h3-25000mah-65w-laptop-power-bank\" title=\"RORRY H3 25000mAh Laptop Power Bank 65W\"><strong>H3</strong></a> provides 25000mAh capacity and up to 65W USB-C output.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "question_Gqnktg": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "4. Can these products charge an iPhone, Apple Watch, and AirPods?",
            "text": "<p>Several products in this collection can charge combinations of iPhone, Apple Watch, and AirPods, including AuraDock M1, AuraDock M2, CharmGo D2, CharmGo D3, Flow CB4, and H1. Compatibility and charging output vary, so check the specifications on each product page before purchasing.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "question_zxNBBt": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "5. Which RORRY power bank can charge a laptop?",
            "text": "<p><strong>RORRY H3</strong> is the laptop-focused option in these setups. It has a 25000mAh battery, supports up to 65W USB-C output, and includes a retractable USB-C cable. Confirm your laptop's charging requirements before use.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "question_afGiHB": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "6. Where do I enter the discount code?",
            "text": "<p>Enter RORRY15, RORRY20, or RORRY25 in the discount-code field at checkout. Use the code that matches the number of eligible items in your cart.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        }
      },
